# Cases for rules/1030-opnsense.xml and decoders/1030-opnsense.xml.
# Lines follow OPNsense's documented syslog formats (BSD/RFC 3164); replace
# them with captures from the real firewall when it exists (W4.1). Real
# captures from OPNsense 26.7 are at the end of this file.

case filterlog block is decoded by the built-in pf decoder
expect rule=87701 level=5 groups=pfsense,firewall_block decoder=pf
